BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
45.354330708661422 569.7640157480313974 Td
(Adults aged 55+ often manage multiple complex chronic conditions \(such as hypertension, congestive heart failure, diabetes,) Tj
T* (and osteoarthritis\) while facing barriers with touchscreen navigation and tiny mobile text. Meanwhile, doctors are overwhelmed) Tj
T* (by unorganized patient communications and raw conversation logs.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (CareVoice AI bridges this critical gap by delivering:) Tj
T* (1. A warm, empathetic, low-latency conversational voice agent tailored for seniors with zero typing friction.) Tj
T* (2. An automated clinical intelligence engine that converts voice conversations into structured, actionable SOAP clinical) Tj
T* (summaries, quantified longitudinal trends, and multi-tier triage flags without clinician burden.) Tj
ET
